            "sid": "REV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini fulla atini teetu imbeekha, fulla barch'uma guddinna Sheet'anaati. Atini maqa kiyya jabeesite qabatte, gaafa Antipa ka guddo na d'ugeese fulla Sheet'ani tauti ijeesanile, atini d'ugefacha na d'ugefatte illakimne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
